-Variablen live bearbeiten (",[38,1110,1111],{},"Eigenes CSS",[150,1113,1114],{},"Eine Theme-Datei in den Themes-Ordner importieren",{"title":108,"searchDepth":109,"depth":109,"links":1116},[1117,1118,1119,1120],{"id":1009,"depth":109,"text":1010},{"id":1043,"depth":109,"text":1044},{"id":1061,"depth":109,"text":1062},{"id":1094,"depth":109,"text":1095},"Farben, Schriften, Buttons und Tabs im Theme Creator gestalten.",{},5,"\u002Ftheme-editor",{"title":995,"description":1121},"h6Hta3TDDcThnouY3Pk_Omvjq8Eb8knx-HIAvf5YZd8",{"id":1128,"title":1129,"body":1130,"description":1267,"extension":117,"meta":1268,"navigation":119,"order":1269,"path":1270,"seo":1271,"stem":1272,"__hash__":1273},"content_de\u002Frecording-editor.md","Aufnahme-Editor",{"type":7,"value":1131,"toc":1261},[1132,1135,1141,1145,1151,1171,1174,1178,1203,1207,1222,1226,1240,1251],[10,1133,1129],{"id":1134},"aufnahme-editor",[14,1136,1137,1138,1140],{},"Nimm einen Clip in SoundNinja auf, schneide ihn zu und importiere ihn in einen Tab. Öffnen über ",[38,1139,527],{}," in der Player-Leiste.",[18,1142,1144],{"id":1143},"eingang-wählen","Eingang wählen",[14,1146,706,1147,1150],{},[38,1148,1149],{},"Einstellungen → Audio",":",[147,1152,1153,1159,1165],{},[150,1154,1155,1158],{},[38,1156,1157],{},"Eingabegeräte"," — Mikrofon",[150,1160,1161,1164],{},[38,1162,1163],{},"Ausgabegeräte (PC-Audio)"," — Loopback dessen, was der PC spielt",[150,1166,1167,1170],{},[38,1168,1169],{},"Eingangslautstärke"," — Aufnahme-Gain von 0 % bis 200 %",[14,1172,1173],{},"Der Aufnahme-Button nutzt das hier gewählte Gerät.",[18,1175,1177],{"id":1176},"take-bearbeiten","Take bearbeiten",[147,1179,1180,1183,1186,1194,1197,1200],{},[150,1181,1182],{},"Aufnehmen und stoppen",[150,1184,1185],{},"Pegelmesser beobachten",[150,1187,1188,41,1191],{},[38,1189,1190],{},"Normalisieren",[38,1192,1193],{},"Rauschunterdrückung",[150,1195,1196],{},"Ganzen Clip trimmen, auf Auswahl trimmen oder Auswahl löschen",[150,1198,1199],{},"Rückgängig \u002F Wiederholen",[150,1201,1202],{},"Rein- und rauszoomen",[18,1204,1206],{"id":1205},"stagen-und-importieren","Stagen und importieren",[222,1208,1209,1212,1215],{},[150,1210,1211],{},"Auswahl oder ganzen Track zur Staging-Liste hinzufügen.",[150,1213,1214],{},"Die Liste startet leer: aufnehmen, bearbeiten, dann Clip hinzufügen.",[150,1216,1217,41,1219,1221],{},[38,1218,531],{},[38,1220,534],{}," in den aktuellen oder einen gewählten Tab.",[18,1223,1225],{"id":1224},"stem-trennung-optional","Stem-Trennung (optional)",[14,1227,1228,1229,1232,1233,41,1236,1239],{},"Offizielle Windows-, macOS- und Linux-Release-Builds enthalten das ",[38,1230,1231],{},"Stems","-Feature. Der Aufnahme-Editor kann ",[38,1234,1235],{},"Gesang",[38,1237,1238],{},"Musik"," mit BS-RoFormer behalten.",[14,1241,1242,1243,1246,1247,1250],{},"Das Modell ist etwa 158 MB und ",[38,1244,1245],{},"nicht"," im Installer. Download unter ",[38,1248,1249],{},"Einstellungen → Stem-Trennung"," oder über den Erststart-Hinweis. Der Windows-Installer kann den Download beim ersten Start anbieten.",[14,1252,1253,1254,1022,1257,1260],{},"Eigene Source-Builds brauchen extra Flags (",[344,1255,1256],{},"tauri:serve:stems",[344,1258,1259],{},"tauri:build:stems",").",{"title":108,"searchDepth":109,"depth":109,"links":1262},[1263,1264,1265,1266],{"id":1143,"depth":109,"text":1144},{"id":1176,"depth":109,"text":1177},{"id":1205,"depth":109,"text":1206},{"id":1224,"depth":109,"text":1225},"Mikrofon oder PC-Audio aufnehmen, den Clip bearbeiten und aufs Board legen.",{},6,"\u002Frecording-editor",{"title":1129,"description":1267},"recording-editor","mBUN6yUiwk-kNjhsf48NlWEXXhjw6cOuSAkybSa9wi0",{"id":1275,"title":1276,"body":1277,"description":1489,"extension":117,"meta":1490,"navigation":119,"order":1491,"path":1492,"seo":1493,"stem":1494,"__hash__":1495},"content_de\u002Fremote-control.md","Fernsteuerung",{"type":7,"value":1278,"toc":1482},[1279,1282,1285,1289,1318,1321,1324,1359,1363,1383,1386,1390,1422,1426,1432],[10,1280,1276],{"id":1281},"fernsteuerung",[14,1283,1284],{},"SoundNinja kann im lokalen Netz lauschen, damit Bitfocus Companion (oder jeder HTTP\u002FWebSocket-Client) Sounds spielt und stoppt.",[18,1286,1288],{"id":1287},"remote-server-einschalten","Remote-Server einschalten",[222,1290,1291,1297,1303,1309],{},[150,1292,1293,1296],{},[38,1294,1295],{},"Einstellungen → Remote"," öffnen.",[150,1298,1299,1300,77],{},"Remote-Server aktivieren. Standardport ist ",[38,1301,1302],{},"7331",[150,1304,1305,1306,77],{},"Optional: Token setzen. Clients senden ihn als Bearer-Token oder ",[344,1307,1308],{},"?token=",[150,1310,1311,1314,1315,1317],{},[344,1312,1313],{},"http:\u002F\u002FIP:PORT"," kopieren oder die System-IP unter ",[38,1316,44],{}," holen.",[14,1319,1320],{},"Windows kann beim ersten Start eine Firewall-Abfrage zeigen. Zugriff im privaten Netz erlauben.",[18,1322,198],{"id":1323},"bitfocus-companion",[222,1325,1326,1333,1341,1352],{},[150,1327,1328,1332],{},[28,1329,198],{"href":1330,"rel":1331},"https:\u002F\u002Fbitfocus.io\u002Fcompanion",[32]," installieren.",[150,1334,1335,1340],{},[28,1336,1339],{"href":1337,"rel":1338},"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002Fmarcus-universe\u002FSoundNinja\u002Freleases\u002Flatest\u002Fdownload\u002FSoundNinja-Companion.tgz",[32],"SoundNinja-Companion.tgz"," herunterladen. Es gibt noch kein Companion-Store-Paket.",[150,1342,1343,1344,1347,1348,1351],{},"In Companion: ",[38,1345,1346],{},"Modules → Load module package"," und die ",[344,1349,1350],{},".tgz"," wählen.",[150,1353,1354,1355,1358],{},"Eine ",[38,1356,1357],{},"Sound Ninja","-Verbindung anlegen. PC-IP, Port und Token eintragen.",[18,1360,1362],{"id":1361},"aktionen","Aktionen",[147,1364,1365,1371,1377],{},[150,1366,1367,1370],{},[38,1368,1369],{},"Trigger Sound"," — aus dem Live-Dropdown wählen oder 8-stellige Sound-ID tippen (Companion-Variablen gehen)",[150,1372,1373,1376],{},[38,1374,1375],{},"Stop Sound"," — einen spielenden Sound per ID stoppen",[150,1378,1379,1382],{},[38,1380,1381],{},"Stop All"," — alle spielenden Sounds stoppen",[14,1384,1385],{},"Sound-ID in SoundNinja über das Button-Kontextmenü oder den Mehrfachauswahl-Chip kopieren.",[18,1387,1389],{"id":1388},"feedbacks-und-variablen","Feedbacks und Variablen",[147,1391,1392,1398,1410,1416],{},[150,1393,1394,1397],{},[38,1395,1396],{},"Sound Playing"," — wahr, solange diese Sound-ID aktiv ist (für Button-Farbe)",[150,1399,1400,1403,1404,1022,1407],{},[344,1401,1402],{},"$(soundninja:connected)"," — ",[344,1405,1406],{},"true",[344,1408,1409],{},"false",[150,1411,1412,1415],{},[344,1413,1414],{},"$(soundninja:playing_count)"," — wie viele Sounds spielen",[150,1417,1418,1421],{},[344,1419,1420],{},"$(soundninja:last_triggered)"," — zuletzt ausgelöste Sound-ID",[18,1423,1425],{"id":1424},"http-api-fortgeschritten","HTTP-API (fortgeschritten)",[14,1427,1428,1429],{},"Basispfad: ",[344,1430,1431],{},"\u002Fapi\u002Fv1",[147,1433,1434,1440,1446,1452,1461,1467,1476],{},[150,1435,1436,1439],{},[344,1437,1438],{},"GET \u002Finfo"," — App-Name, Version, Protokoll, ob ein Token nötig ist",[150,1441,1442,1445],{},[344,1443,1444],{},"GET \u002Fsounds"," — Soundliste (id, name, tabs, active)",[150,1447,1448,1451],{},[344,1449,1450],{},"GET \u002Fstate"," — Sounds plus gerade spielende IDs",[150,1453,1454,549,1457,1460],{},[344,1455,1456],{},"POST \u002Ftrigger",[344,1458,1459],{},"{ \"id\" }"," — Sound abspielen",[150,1462,1463,1466],{},[344,1464,1465],{},"GET \u002Ftrigger\u002F:id"," — abspielen (einfach im Browser testen)",[150,1468,1469,1472,1473,1475],{},[344,1470,1471],{},"POST \u002Fstop"," mit optionalem ",[344,1474,1459],{}," — einen Sound oder alle stoppen",[150,1477,1478,1481],{},[344,1479,1480],{},"GET \u002Fws"," — Live-Status; Trigger\u002FStop eingehend senden",{"title":108,"searchDepth":109,"depth":109,"links":1483},[1484,1485,1486,1487,1488],{"id":1287,"depth":109,"text":1288},{"id":1323,"depth":109,"text":198},{"id":1361,"depth":109,"text":1362},{"id":1388,"depth":